+        Killing the `docker exec` client does not touch the command inside the
+        container, which then runs on unobserved; for an agent that means a
+        retried attempt races the timed-out one for the same workspace. The
+        exec's processes all inherit the marker in their environment, so they
+        are found through /proc. Runs as root so every environ is readable.
